{"id":12808,"date":"2025-06-11T17:50:05","date_gmt":"2025-06-11T17:50:05","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/?post_type=event&#038;p=12808"},"modified":"2025-06-11T18:05:00","modified_gmt":"2025-06-11T18:05:00","slug":"aims-ghana-qtedu-global-event","status":"publish","type":"event","link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/event\/aims-ghana-qtedu-global-event\/","title":{"rendered":"AIMS Ghana QTEdu Global Event"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>The AIMS Ghana QTEdu Global Event is a week-long celebration of innovation, collaboration and education.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><strong>Theme:&nbsp;Accelerating Capacity Building to Advance Quantum Science &amp; Technology<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>With Ghana having played a pivotal role in the drafting and submission of the resolution that led to the United Nations&#8217; proclamation of <strong>2025 as the International Year of Quantum (IYQ)<\/strong>, we are honoured to join the global community in marking this significant milestone through the convening of the <strong>Quantum Technology Education (QTEdu) Global Event<\/strong>, under the theme: <strong>\u201cAccelerating Capacity Building to Advance Quantum Science &amp; Technology.\u201d<\/strong><\/p>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3>Key activities <\/h3>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>The AIMS Quantum Hackathon (Quantathon), held in partnership with the Open Quantum Institute (OQI)<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>The Global <a>Quantum Science &amp; Technology Education <\/a>Workshop<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>A Public Lecture and Keynote Panel on Quantum Science &amp; Technology<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3>Goals<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Inspire and build capacity among young people in Africa.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Create a blueprint for advancing quantum science and technology education globally.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<p><\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3>Why Attend<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul>\n<li>Gain hands-on experience in quantum technology. <\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Network with global experts and peers.<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Be part of shaping the future of quantum education.<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-advgb-button alignnone\"><a class=\"wp-block-advgb-button_link advgbbtn-53cd1ffd-950e-4ba1-a80a-e7764c7ff4e7\" href=\"https:\/\/qtedu.aims.edu.gh\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span>VISIT OFFICIAL WEBSITE FOR MORE INFO<\/span><\/a><\/div>\n\n\n\n<h2><\/h2>\n\n\n\n<figure class=\"is-layout-flex wp-block-gallery-1 wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"1024\" height=\"298\" data-id=\"12814\"  src=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/06\/QTEdu-Logos-1024x298.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-12814\" srcset=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/06\/QTEdu-Logos-1024x298.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/06\/QTEdu-Logos-300x87.jpg 300w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/06\/QTEdu-Logos-768x224.jpg 768w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/06\/QTEdu-Logos-1536x448.jpg 1536w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/06\/QTEdu-Logos-2048x597.jpg 2048w, https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/06\/QTEdu-Logos-18x5.jpg 18w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1024px) 100vw, 1024px\" \/><\/figure>\n<\/figure>\n<style class=\"advgb-styles-renderer\">.advgbbtn-53cd1ffd-950e-4ba1-a80a-e7764c7ff4e7{font-size:18px;color:#fff !important;background-color:#dc3545 !important;margin:0px 0px 0px 0px !important;padding:10px 30px 10px 30px;border-width:1px !important;border-style:none;border-radius:50px !important;}.advgbbtn-53cd1ffd-950e-4ba1-a80a-e7764c7ff4e7:hover{box-shadow:1px 1px 12px 0px #ccc;opacity:1;transition:all 0.2s ease;}.advgbbtn-53cd1ffd-950e-4ba1-a80a-e7764c7ff4e7 > i {display: none !important;}<\/style>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>The AIMS Ghana QTEdu Global Event is a week-long celebration of innovation, collaboration and education. Theme:&nbsp;Accelerating Capacity Building to Advance Quantum Science &amp; Technology With Ghana having played a pivotal role in the drafting and submission of the resolution that led to the United Nations&#8217; proclamation of 2025 as the International Year of Quantum (IYQ),<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":10,"featured_media":12812,"parent":0,"template":"","meta":{"advgb_blocks_editor_width":"","advgb_blocks_columns_visual_guide":""},"tags":[],"event_types":[44],"event_times":[],"acf":[],"featured_img":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-content\/uploads\/sites\/4\/2025\/06\/QTEdu-Full-Flyer-v1L.jpg","coauthors":[],"author_meta":{"author_link":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/author\/charlene\/","display_name":"charlene"},"relative_dates":{"created":"Posted 5 months ago","modified":"Updated 5 months ago"},"absolute_dates":{"created":"Posted on June 11, 2025","modified":"Updated on June 11, 2025"},"absolute_dates_time":{"created":"Posted on June 11, 2025 5:50 pm","modified":"Updated on June 11, 2025 6:05 pm"},"featured_img_caption":"","tax_additional":{"post_tag":{"linked":[],"unlinked":[],"slug":"post_tag","name":"Tags"},"event_types":{"linked":["<a href=\"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/event_type\/special-event\/\" class=\"advgb-post-tax-term\">Special Event<\/a>"],"unlinked":["<span class=\"advgb-post-tax-term\">Special Event<\/span>"],"slug":"event_types","name":"Event Type"},"event_times":{"linked":[],"unlinked":[],"slug":"event_times","name":"Event Time"}},"series_order":"","_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event\/12808"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/event"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/10"}],"version-history":[{"count":8,"href":"https:\/\/aims.edu.gh\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/event\/12808\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":12822,"href"